<title>THAILAND: Thailand says disagrees with Moody's review.</title>
<headline>Thailand says disagrees with Moody's review.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand said on Friday that it disagreed with Moody's plans to place the country's long-term debt rating under review.</p>
<p>&quot;We would like to see the reasons why they did this, because we think the situation is improving and will improve further over time,&quot; a central bank spokesman told Reuters.</p>
</text>
